        <title type="html"><![CDATA[5 ways to fix misleading vulnerability severities with policy]]></title>
        <id>https://about.gitlab.com/blog/severity-override-vulnerability-management-policy/</id>
        <link href="https://about.gitlab.com/blog/severity-override-vulnerability-management-policy/"/>
        <updated>2026-05-13T21:07:03.632Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="image" data-v-329ca616=""><img data-nuxt-img="" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1772630163/akp8ly2mrsfrhsb0liyb.png 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1772630163/akp8ly2mrsfrhsb0liyb.png 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" fetch-priority="high" loading="eager" alt="" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/about-gitlab-com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_lfill/v1772630163/akp8ly2mrsfrhsb0liyb.png" data-v-329ca616=""></div><h2 class="sr-only" data-v-329ca616="">Featured post</h2><div class="text" data-v-329ca616=""><h3 class="slp-text-heading4-bold" data-v-64ad2128="" data-v-329ca616=""><!--[-->5 ways to fix misleading vulnerability severities with policy<!--]--><!----></h3><p class="slp-text-heading5" data-v-64ad2128="" data-v-329ca616=""><!--[-->Default CVSS scores don't reflect your actual risk. Use GitLab severity override policies to automate adjustments based on CVE, CWE, file path, and directory.<!--]--><!----></p><span class="slp-text-body3-bold author" data-v-64ad2128="" data-v-329ca616=""><!--[-->Author: Grant Hickman<!--]--><!----></span><a class="cta slp-mt-16 slp-btn slp-btn-primary cta slp-mt-16" data-ga-name="5 ways to fix misleading vulnerability severities with policy" data-ga-location="body" href="/blog/severity-override-vulnerability-management-policy/" data-v-c6fd7cb9="" data-v-329ca616=""><!--[-->Read Post<!--]--></a></div>]]></content>
